---
/**
 * Ownership strip: a drafting title block showing what each of the three
 * systems owns. HTML rather than SVG so the lists stay selectable and
 * reflow on small screens.
 */
---

<figure class="ownership" aria-labelledby="own-title">
  <div class="own-grid">
    <div class="own-card">
      <p class="own-band">TRIAGELAB</p>
      <ul>
        <li>ticket routing + policy</li>
        <li>clarification reservations</li>
        <li>launch evidence binding</li>
        <li>bounded case inputs</li>
        <li>watchdog budgets</li>
        <li>evidence validation</li>
        <li>reports + cleanup</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="own-card">
      <p class="own-band">KAGENT</p>
      <ul>
        <li>investigator agent + tools</li>
        <li>sessions</li>
        <li>sandbox templates</li>
        <li>sandbox lifecycle</li>
        <li>model gateway</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="own-card">
      <p class="own-band">AGENT SUBSTRATE</p>
      <ul>
        <li>worker pools</li>
        <li>gvisor / microvm</li>
        <li>snapshots</li>
        <li>resource limits</li>
        <li>deny-by-default egress</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="own-title">
    Three systems, one case: TriageLab owns everything between the ticket
    and the report; kagent owns the agent and its sandbox API; Agent
    Substrate owns the isolation the sandbox runs on.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ownership {
    margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .own-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(11.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--tl-line-frame);
    border: 1px solid var(--tl-line-frame);
    border-radius: var(--tl-radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-plate);
  }
  .own-card {
    background: var(--tl-plate);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    /* Starlight's markdown styles give siblings a top margin; keep the
       title-block row flush. */
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .own-band {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--tl-ink);
    color: var(--tl-paper);
    font-family: var(--tl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;
  }
  .own-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.875rem 0.875rem 1rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4375rem;
  }
  .own-card li {
    font-family: var(--tl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--tl-ink-2);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
  .own-card li::before {
    content: "+";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--tl-accent);
  }
  .ownership figcaption {
    font-family: var(--tl-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--tl-ink-muted);
    padding: 0.625rem 0.25rem 0;
  }
</style>
